124240933_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=sd2Et8nxy50Q7kNvwH-9sxH&_nc_oc=AdrM6lOPVm5KyyxeNn8faVE0MXaJY46V6Kh4XZFyZQHGAj78VDSREKu9nxuZ-iXVFtw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af95aIeR12AEDN5EwyqEuapqb10D28y-kC5isjh8IEbpxA&oe=6A300573"}, {"file_name": "6_2560x1440.png", "id": "1142946040960088", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392329_1142946044293421_1439860664775965462_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=c0-q7_sHEzYQ7kNvwEhRg3Z&_nc_oc=AdpPRXXJiBXKOv_hRvf1K-quHwzw94A_n1TsgKbDJD48hNN1Q3kbGCTRoglNLF6_MyQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af97RJYbsLp1Bm_eoN98M6_GcyU5L47DHpAgxTL7zEJ0fQ&oe=6A2FF787"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "9_2560x1440.png", "id": "1624384528466838", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393406_1624384531800171_5851553794396368265_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=PgJZQOGPbt8Q7kNvwFarF9u&_nc_oc=Adp6YmYEQmq6du0A_4Z73dlwLyxjplpZNbaCH58aPF1NgnLb8dtrZrTgsqAXmRG0v1k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_rKQQRsMxh9yTBC8V1eMnM0813N7VmNXVYdZ0p0EyLAw&oe=6A301211"}, "display_name": "ZOMVIRUS", "keywords": ["Zombies", "Survival", "Horror", "multiplayer", "shooter"], "long_description": "Survive the Korean Zombie Apocalypse in VR\nZOMVIRUS is an immersive VR zombie survival shooter set in Seoul\u2019s Hapjeong Station (Hongdae). Built with Unity and optimized for Meta Quest, it delivers smooth 80 FPS performance, minimizing motion sickness with lightweight assets and PBR rendering. Neon-lit streets, subway tunnels, and abandoned club are recreated with authentic Korean detail.\nUnlike slow and predictable enemies, you will face fast and intelligent Korean zombies that chase, flank, and coordinate with swarm AI. Their behavior adapts to your location, noise, and vision, keeping survival tense at all times.\nEquip yourself with 20+ realistic weapons, including the K2 rifle and K5 pistol, designed with manual reloads, two-handed handling, recoil, and authentic ballistics.\nZOMVIRUS also emphasizes VR interactivity: grab weapons, open doors, move objects, and trigger dynamic reactions such as destructible items, lighting, and sound.\nThe game is built for the future with modular design and multiplayer-ready architecture using Photon/Fusion. Expect regular updates with new maps, weapons, and zombie types.\n\nKey Features\nKorean Setting \u2013 Explore Hapjeong (Hongdae) with authentic realism.\nFast & Intelligent Zombies \u2013 Smarter, faster, more dangerous AI.\n20+ Realistic Weapons \u2013 Includes iconic K2 and K5.\nImmersive VR Combat \u2013 Manual reloads, recoil, melee combat.\nMultiple Modes \u2013 Campaign, survival, endless horde.\nLive Updates \u2013 Continuous new content.", "short_description": "ZOMVIRUS is a VR zombie survival shooter set in Hapjeong Station (Hongdae), Seoul. Players face not slow and predictable enemies, but fast and intelligent Korean zombies that chase, flank, and coordinate attacks. Armed with over 20 realistic weapons, including the iconic K2 rifle and K5 pistol, players must master immersive VR combat mechanics and fight for survival in a uniquely Korean apocalypse."}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1450444186250842", "locale": "es_LA", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "ZOMVIRUS", "keywords": ["survival", "horror", "shooter", "multiplayer", "zombie"], "long_description": "Sobrevive al apocalipsis zombi coreano en VR\nZOMVIRUS es un shooter VR inmersivo de supervivencia ambientado en Hapjeong (Hongdae), Se\u00fal. Optimizado para Meta Quest, ofrece 90 FPS con texturas ligeras y renderizado PBR. Calles de ne\u00f3n, metro y hospitales abandonados recreados con realismo.\nEnfrenta a zombis coreanos r\u00e1pidos e inteligentes que flanquean y coordinan ataques mediante IA. Usa 20+ armas realistas, como el fusil K2 y la pistola K5, con recarga manual y bal\u00edstica aut\u00e9ntica.\nLa interactividad VR permite tomar armas, abrir puertas y mover objetos. Dise\u00f1o modular y arquitectura multijugador garantizan actualizaciones constantes.", "short_description": "\u201cZOMVIRUS es un shooter VR de supervivencia en Se\u00fal (estaci\u00f3n Hapjeong/Hongdae) contra zombis coreanos r\u00e1pidos e inteligentes, con m\u00e1s de 20 armas realistas, incluido el K2 y K5.\u201d"}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "793494553431102", "locale": "de_DE", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "ZOMVIRUS", "keywords": ["shooter", "Horror", "multiplayer", "survival", "zombies"], "long_description": "\u00dcberlebe die koreanische Zombie-Apokalypse in VR\nZOMVIRUS ist ein immersiver VR-Survival-Shooter in der Hapjeong-Station (Hongdae), Seoul. Optimiert f\u00fcr Meta Quest mit 90 FPS, leichten Texturen und PBR-Rendering. Erkunde Neonstra\u00dfen, U-Bahn-Tunnel und verlassene Krankenh\u00e4user.\nTrete gegen schnelle und intelligente koreanische Zombies an, die dich mit Schwarm-KI verfolgen und flankieren. Nutze 20+ Waffen, darunter das K2-Gewehr und die K5-Pistole, mit manuellem Nachladen und realistischem R\u00fccksto\u00df.\nMit VR-Interaktivit\u00e4t kannst du Waffen greifen, T\u00fcren \u00f6ffnen und Objekte bewegen. Modularer Aufbau und Multiplayer-Architektur erm\u00f6glichen laufende Updates.", "short_description": "\u201cZOMVIRUS ist ein VR-Zombie-Survival-Shooter in Seoul (Station Hapjeong/Hongdae) mit schnellen, intelligenten koreanischen Zombies und 20+ realistischen Waffen inkl. K2 und K5.\u201d"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "04_Landscape.png", "id": "2711112855886481", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499310792_2711112859219814_3765518369288507276_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=OkKL76JwVnYQ7kNvwG-gU41&_nc_oc=AdovNxUDH81l39WigxvtW71